# House Hlaalu: Edryno Arethi's first duties, Vivec.
# "sealed report" (HH_BankCourier): the report carried to Baren Alen in the Hlaalu Vaults ("Is that report for
# me?"; "Yes, take it." 1: 50), reported (100).
# "Murudius Flaeus" (HH_BuriedTreasure): Murudius in Hla Oad gives up the key to his chest ("debt money": 50;
# SetDisposition stands in for persuasion), Edryno takes the 800 drakes ("Yes, here it is." 1: 100).
# `approach` stands in for the travel (PositionCell first for an unscripted NPC: a non-persistent ref is not found
# while its cell is unloaded).
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_bank_courier
run
player->PositionCell 145 -99 -86 0 "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House" == 1
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask business
ask sealed report
expect GetJournalIndex HH_BankCourier == 10
expect player->GetItemCount "bk_TreasuryReport" == 1
bye
run
player->PositionCell 245 -349 -119 0 "Vivec, Hlaalu Vaults"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Hlaalu Vaults" == 1
approach 0556AF5D
talk baren alen
ask sealed report
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_BankCourier == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 145 -99 -86 0 "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House" == 1
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask sealed report
expect GetJournalIndex HH_BankCourier == 100
bye
end

case hh_buried_treasure
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask business
ask Murudius Flaeus
expect GetJournalIndex HH_BuriedTreasure == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 4035 4067 2306 0 "Hla Oad, Murudius Flaeus's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Hla Oad, Murudius Flaeus's House" == 1
approach 0597DB64
run
"murudius flaeus"->SetDisposition 100
talk murudius flaeus
ask debt money
expect GetJournalIndex HH_BuriedTreasure == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 145 -99 -86 0 "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Hlaalu Edryno Arethi's House" == 1
approach 0541184D
talk edryno arethi
ask Murudius Flaeus
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_BuriedTreasure == 100
bye
end
